= Thuringia

On 16 October Thuringia's SPD Minister-President August Frölich forms a similar cabinet, with KPD ministers, after Saxony's example. Two workers' governments now stand in central Germany, in territory between Berlin and Bavaria, and the Reich government in Berlin calls them a conspiracy.

